WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.000
The second Auditor General report, June 2025, expanded the investigation government-wide.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:15.550
It found 106 GCStrategies contracts across 31 federal departments totalling 92.7 million dollars.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:21.900
GCStrategies helped write the requirements for a 25 million dollar contract it then won.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.862
Officials could not prove work was completed before payment.
